(def not-page "(not value)\n\nReturns the opposite of a `bool`.\n\nIt emits `!value`.")
(def cond-page "(cond (test body ...) clause ...)\n\nRuns the first clause whose test is true.\n\nA last clause `(else body ...)` runs when no test is true. Without one,\nevery body must return unit, and so does the call.")
